{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x21a1a9",
      "back_en": "with a crest engraved in it.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a22f",
      "back_en": "Wh-What is...!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Expressa choque adequadamente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a448",
      "back_en": "showed to him, I think.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a460",
      "back_en": "What? This thing here?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a4a6",
      "back_en": "changes immediately as they see the box.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a4cf",
      "back_en": "A-Haku!? I-Is that... Is that really...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Gagueira inicia com letra diferente, mas aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a4f8",
      "back_en": "The crest engraved in it. That is--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a590",
      "back_en": "those entrusted and chosen by the Mikado himself!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'confiados' soa entrusted, mas sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a63c",
      "back_en": "like that on you, I think!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a657",
      "back_en": "Uh, well. That's...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a66c",
      "back_en": "How will I explain it to these guys?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a6be",
      "back_en": "tell everything to them...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a6db",
      "back_en": "MASTER HAAAKU!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a71b",
      "back_en": "O, what fortuitous chance to reunite upon",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a7a4",
      "back_en": "O, how my heart hath greeted thee!!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'missed thee' (sentiu falta) virou 'saudou' (cumprimentou)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a880",
      "back_en": "O nature's axiom, cast yourself before our Master",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a96b",
      "back_en": "O generous fates! I did not expect that ye would",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a99e",
      "back_en": "explore these fantastical depths.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'come to plumb' simplificado, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a9c6",
      "back_en": "It seemeth, Master Haku, that the threads of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a9f5",
      "back_en": "our fates are entwined eternally...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ab89",
      "back_en": "In truth, such an endeavor suits me FAR more",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel ao tom arcaico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21abd1",
      "back_en": "The thrill of histories yet to discover!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21abf6",
      "back_en": "Relics unearthed! Truths yet to be told!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ac19",
      "back_en": "My scholar's heart QUIVERETH!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'QUIVERETH' deixado em inglês, não traduzido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21acda",
      "back_en": "Even our team has not gone beyond that",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'our reach' (alcance) virou 'nossa equipe' (team)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b217",
      "back_en": "Sir Haku... Does something trouble you?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b312",
      "back_en": "Then our investigation has come to its",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b538",
      "back_en": "Ugh...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b5cf",
      "back_en": "Master, could it be that you...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b620",
      "back_en": "in this ruin, something bothers me...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b6fa",
      "back_en": "Stand back now.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b70b",
      "back_en": "Jachdwalt?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nome mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b7af",
      "back_en": "Serious, my boy...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b7e0",
      "back_en": "This is... It can't be...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f867",
      "back_en": "Ah, grant me but a moment more, and I",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f895",
      "back_en": "duly light another torch then.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'pois' adicionado, mínimo."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f8f1",
      "back_en": "Haku, did you just do something?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f973",
      "back_en": "I was just muttering something to myself,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f9d1",
      "back_en": "Nekone, this is exactly what...?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'what exactly is this' virou 'isto é exatamente o que', sentido alterado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f9f8",
      "back_en": "This... must be a necropolis.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'some sort of' omitido, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fa21",
      "back_en": "A necropolis...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fadb",
      "back_en": "No... this is not just my imagination...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fb01",
      "back_en": "I remember this place...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fb2c",
      "back_en": "This place... it's not just a cemetery.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'it's no cemetery' (não é cemitério) virou 'não é só um cemitério'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fbae",
      "back_en": "I know... I used to believe that too.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fbdb",
      "back_en": "I... know this place...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fbf4",
      "back_en": "Wha--!? Everyone, get back!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fc1b",
      "back_en": "...exactly the same as before...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fc6b",
      "back_en": "What's the matter, dear sister?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fd94",
      "back_en": "Could this person really be...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fdb4",
      "back_en": "It's exactly the same...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fdcd",
      "back_en": "Then... that means this person is...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fe5a",
      "back_en": "...Oh, how terrible. Risen from the dead, then?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Oh dear' intensificado, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fe82",
      "back_en": "Impossible. I was certain he was dead...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ff50",
      "back_en": "What the--!? What IS that thing!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ffc0",
      "back_en": "How...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ffc8",
      "back_en": "How did a Tatari...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ffdc",
      "back_en": "But then... what about Haku...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fffc",
      "back_en": "Come on! You're kidding me!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Vem lá' não é natural; palavrão suavizado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x220055",
      "back_en": "I must admit, Haku... I certainly did not expect",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x220088",
      "back_en": "such... developments...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2200a0",
      "back_en": "Hee... hee hee hee hee hee...♪",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x220394",
      "back_en": "We have no choice. We'll have to fight our way",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2203c8",
      "back_en": "out. They don't die, so don't waste",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2203ff",
      "back_en": "We need to find an exit and move quickly",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'make a break' adaptado, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a106",
      "back_en": "We go over to talk to a guard first.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a1c6",
      "back_en": "It's lacquered outside with gold patterns,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21a413",
      "back_en": "himself.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ad85",
      "back_en": "Yes, dear sister!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21adc7",
      "back_en": "anticipation.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ae05",
      "back_en": "different than usual?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21ae4d",
      "back_en": "able to reach...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21afa2",
      "back_en": "Exactly! But the sites are so far apart.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b2b2",
      "back_en": "I'll be there in a second.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b540",
      "back_en": "Again... What's this strange feeling that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21b64a",
      "back_en": "It won't be possible to open it...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'It is no use' omitido, sentido essencial mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21f7b3",
      "back_en": "capsule01_hatch_4",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "String de sistema mantida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fc3c",
      "back_en": "Dear Nekone?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Nome trocado: 'Kuon' virou 'Nekone'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21fd44",
      "back_en": "This is unbelievable. There is not even the",
